sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as MCP 客户端
    participant Tool as create_note
    participant Write as flomoWriteClient
    participant HTTP as FlomoHttpClient
    participant Flomo as flomo Web
    participant Parser as memoParser

    Client->>Tool: call create_note(content,tags)
    Tool->>Write: create({ content, tags })
    Write->>Write: formatCreateContent()
    Write->>HTTP: requestJson(FLOMO_WRITE_ENDPOINT, payload)
    HTTP->>Flomo: POST/PUT internal endpoint
    Flomo-->>HTTP: raw JSON
    HTTP-->>Write: raw JSON
    Write->>Parser: parseMemo(raw)
    Parser-->>Write: Memo
    Write-->>Tool: Memo
    Tool-->>Client: { ok: true, memo }
